</div>
<span class="text-label-sm font-label-sm text-outline">Xác thực ví</span>
</div>
<p class="text-body-sm font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-4">
    Nhập mã PIN gồm 6 chữ số để phê duyệt lệnh rút về tài khoản Vietcombank:
  </p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-6 gap-2 sm:gap-3 mb-4">
<input class="h-12 text-center text-xl font-bold rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/50 focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/20 bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface" maxlength="1" type="password" value="8">
<input class="h-12 text-center text-xl font-bold rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/50 focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/20 bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface" maxlength="1" type="password" value="2">
<input class="h-12 text-center text-xl font-bold rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/50 focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/20 bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface" maxlength="1" type="password" value="9">
<input class="h-12 text-center text-xl font-bold rounded-xl border-2 border-primary ring-2 ring-primary/20 bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface" maxlength="1" placeholder="•" type="password" value="">
<input class="h-12 text-center text-xl font-bold rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/40 bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface" maxlength="1" placeholder="•" type="password" value="">
<input class="h-12 text-center text-xl font-bold rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/40 bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface" maxlength="1" placeholder="•" type="password" value="">
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-center">
<button class="text-label-sm font-label-sm text-primary hover:underline font-semibold transition-colors" type="button">Quên mã PIN?</button>
<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-label-sm font-label-sm text-outline">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary">shield</span>
<span>Giao dịch an toàn</span>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Nút hành động chính cao 50px -->
<button class="brand-btn-teal w-full rounded-xl font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-sm" type="button">
<span>Xác nhận rút 500.000đ</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">arrow_forward</span>
</button>
<p class="text-center text-label-sm font-label-sm text-outline">Bằng việc xác nhận, bạn đồng ý với <a class="underline text-primary hover:underline" href="#">Điều khoản dịch vụ rút tiền FinVault</a></p>
</div>
</div>
<footer class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-outline-variant/30 text-center text-body-sm font-body-sm text-outline">
<p>© 2025 FinVault. Nền tảng ví điện tử cá nhân an toàn &amp; bảo mật hàng đầu Việt Nam.</p>
</footer></main>
</div>
<script>
    // Lightweight script to enable interactive behavior on chips & inputs
    document.querySelectorAll('.grid-cols-6 input').forEach((elem, index, array) => {
      elem.addEventListener('keyup', (e) => {
        if (e.key >= '0' && e.key <= '9') {
          if (index < array.length - 1) array[index + 1].focus();
        } else if (e.key === 'Backspace') {
          if (index > 0) array[index - 1].focus();
        }
      });
    });
  </script>
</body></html>
